\begin{aligned}
\text{lower index:}&\quad -\Gamma,\\
\text{upper index:}&\quad +\Gamma.
\end{aligned}}$ For a higher-rank tensor, one connection term appears for each index, with its sign determined by whether that index is lower or upper.

