\begin{aligned}
g_{tt}&=-(1+2\Phi),\\
\frac{d^2x^i}{dt^2}&=-\partial_i\Phi
\end{aligned}
}
\qquad(c=1).$ With units restored, the metric correction is $2\Phi/c^2$, while the acceleration remains $-\boldsymbol{\nabla}\Phi$.

